id=usbmanager_dcs
name=USB Manager (no LSPosed)
version=v1.4.0
versionCode=140
author=@Dev_DcS
description=Asks whether to trust a computer/car with data (then USB mode + ADB) and remembers the answer per device for 12 h. USB guard: restarts the phone if an unknown device is connected while locked and it is not unlocked in time. Optional full USB data block (kernel-enforced on the dev-dcs GKI builds) and auto restart when not unlocked for a set time. No Xposed needed.
